+//   are all tagged keys: varint amount, 0x03 (TXOUT_TO_TAGGED_KEY), key[32], view tag[1], with
+//   view tag = cn_fast_hash("view_tag" || 8rA || varint(output index))[0] (derive_view_tag;
+//   Monero's formula, docs/tx-v2.md in the xkr repository). The transaction hash stays
